(text "Releaf - five hand-soldered parts" (at 17.78 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1582a43d-dc40-5909-bf4c-8c6e5e6c6b4f"))
(text "v1.0 prototype | 80 x 20 x 1.6 mm | two layers | panel supply 41-42 V" (at 17.78 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3612b2d5-186f-5684-a4a4-c8df900964c6"))
(text "SW1 connects BUCK_5V to C3_5V in ON; OFF leaves C3_5V for USB.\nTurn OFF before plugging USB in. Unplug USB before switching ON.\nSW1 switches only 5 V; the converter input remains connected to the panel." (at 17.78 96.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "933705b8-b952-5ed1-a1fd-1d819958662b"))
(text "DATA: GPIO4 TX + GPIO5 RX; use the existing open-drain firmware.\nR1 is the single 10k pull-up to 3V3. C1 positive lead goes to PANEL_41V.\nJ1 is integral exposed PCB copper, not an extra component." (at 17.78 154.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7374a425-acf2-526b-ac57-0a89ba7f187b"))
(text "FRONT: components; rear contacts appear left 41V, centre GND, right DATA.\nBACK / CONTACT VIEW: left DATA, centre GND, right 41V.\nThree 1.5 x 10 mm rear pads; two 3 x 9 mm latch openings; four edge U-notches." (at 17.78 170.18 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "263ddbfb-c79b-5255-859a-bbebd205bd85"))
